# Fix Manage Data Dropdowns & Field Order

The user reported that the Activity, Division, and Region dropdowns on the Manage Data page (Production tab) don't match the rest of the tool. Additionally, the field order in Region Management needs to be updated to match the requested flow: Activity -> Division -> Region.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> I will be updating the [EmissionSource](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/new/server/models.py#123-144) database model to include an `equipment_id` field. This ensures consistency between the inventory and the calculation records.

> [!NOTE]
> The **Type** dropdown for emission sources will now include the full list of process types from the calculator (e.g., Pneumatic Devices, Storage Tanks, Well Completions, etc.).

